WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:46.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.500
We were caught in the friction, dragging the weight

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.800
A system at rest, locked outside the gate

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:56.000
But the thrusters ignited, the circuits turned on

00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:00.200
The terrestrial gravity is completely gone

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:07.800
We're building momentum, we're crossing the line

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:13.800
Leaving the shadow of the planet behind!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.200
We've got inertia!

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:20.800
A velocity they can't contain!

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:24.200
Gliding through the starlight, breaking the chain

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.800
We are unstoppable, moving through the night

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:36.500
We've got inertia, riding on the light!

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.500
They tried to calculate, tried to chart our course

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:46.000
But they never understood the nature of the force

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:49.200
Energy conserved, never truly lost

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:53.000
We reached escape velocity and we know the cost

00:01:53.100 --> 00:02:00.800
We're building momentum, we're crossing the line

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:06.800
Leaving the shadow of the planet behind!

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.200
We've got inertia!

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.800
A velocity they can't contain!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.200
Gliding through the starlight, breaking the chain

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.800
We are unstoppable, moving through the night

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:32.000
We've got inertia, riding on the light!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:03:28.500
[Synthesizer Solo]

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:32.200
No atmospheric drag

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.800
Can slow down this fraction

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:42.200
Of stardust and sound, we have left the ground!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.800
We've got inertia!

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.200
A velocity they can't contain!

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:52.800
Gliding through the starlight, breaking the chain

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:56.200
We are unstoppable, moving through the night

00:03:56.300 --> 00:04:03.200
We've got inertia, riding on the light!

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.800
Unstoppable...

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:13.500
In the zero-G...

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:22.000
Riding on the light...

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:44.000
[Outro]
